# Local working files, scans, OCR, reviews, backups and browser captures
/work/
/output/
/.playwright-cli/
/.baoyu-skills/
/CONTEXT.md
/DECISIONS.md
/DESIGN.md
/QA.md
/COLOR-REVIEW.md

# Generated previews and large portable edition (rebuild locally)
/*-全书中文阅读版.html
/book-preview.html
/color-review.html
/font-comparison.html
